    "sections": {
        "description": "Restaurant Eatery Theme provides a structured layout for presenting food- related information, menus, services, and contact details online. Restaurant owners can use dedicated sections to display opening hours, locations, menus, and other essential information. Cafes and coffee shops can organize featured beverages, food items, and introductory content using image and text sections. Bakeries and other food businesses can present product categories, descriptions, prices, and images in an organized layout. Fast food restaurants can highlight selected menu items and ordering information, while fine dining restaurants can use structured pages for menus, reservations, and location details. Family restaurants can present dining information alongside photographs and service details. The theme can also accommodate content for food trucks, bars and grills, pubs, bistros, and diners, with customizable sections for menus and business information. Catering businesses can use service pages to describe offerings and provide inquiry details. Responsive design helps pages adapt to different screen sizes. Customization options can be used to adjust colors, typography, images, navigation, and page sections. Social media links and contact information can also be incorporated into the site structure for easier access."
    },
